flowchart TD
 Install-->Cache[Explicit precache attempts]
 Request-->Network{Network responds?}
 Network--yes-->Online[Network response]
 Network--no-->Hit{Cache hit?}
 Hit--yes-->Local[Cached response]
 Hit--no-->Error[Error; not whole-app offline]
 State[Local state]-->Sync{Authenticated and online?}
 Sync--yes-->API[Optional API sync]
 Sync--no-->Stay[Remain local]
